&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;notion-enable-hover&quot; data-token-index=&quot;0&quot;&gt;About Fay&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Fay, our mission is to make nutrition a foundational pillar of preventative care, improving outcomes, accessibility, and affordability at scale. We&#39;re building AI-powered infrastructure to transform preventative healthcare. Think that&#39;s bold? We&#39;re just getting started.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Today, Fay is a three-sided marketplace connecting providers, patients, and payers to revolutionize preventative care delivery. Our b2b2c business-in-a-box solution empowers dietitians to deliver high-quality, affordable nutrition care, helps patients take control of their health, and enables payers to build healthier member populations. Nutrition is our starting point, not the finish line. The platform we&#39;re building will expand into new areas of preventative health and wellness as we grow.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re proud to be one of the fastest-growing companies in healthtech, backed by category-defining investors like General Catalyst, Forerunner, 1984, and Goldman Sachs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ready to leverage AI-driven technology to transform preventative care and make a real-world impact on health? Let&#39;s talk.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;This Business Operations role sits at the center of Fay&#39;s three-sided marketplace — payers, providers, and members — and the flywheel that connects clinical quality, payer trust, provider economics, and member retention. It works across Member Experience, Provider Operations &amp;amp; Growth, Clinical Operations, and Payer Operations, flexing toward whichever side of the marketplace needs the most attention at any given time.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;This is a strategic, analytical role grounded in operations. You&#39;ll own data and insights that drive decision-making, build a strong understanding of supply and demand dynamics across payers, providers, and members, and translate those insights into clear, actionable recommendations. You&#39;ll also help build and maintain the operating systems that keep a fast-moving, complex organization aligned and executing effectively.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;At Fay, we value people who are adaptable, resourceful, and excited to tackle new challenges as the business evolves. Priorities in this role will shift as the business does — one quarter you might be deep in payer economics, the next focused on provider supply, the next on member retention. We&#39;re looking for someone who&#39;s energized by that kind of movement, comfortable getting hands-on wherever the highest-impact work is, and eager to apply their skills across the marketplace rather than in a single fixed lane.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Be Doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Strategy &amp;amp; Business Analysis&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;[li_&amp;amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Partner with team leads across payer, provider, and member functions to generate insights on cohorts, trends, and opportunities to reduce churn and improve retention&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Conduct market and competitive analysis to inform positioning across clinical quality, provider economics, payer relationships, and member experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Lead deep-dive analyses on strategic and operational questions and translate findings into clear recommendations and priorities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Growth &amp;amp; Marketplace Dynamics&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;[li_&amp;amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Own analysis of supply and demand dynamics across the payer, provider, and member marketplace, helping shift toward a more predictive model&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Support Provider Growth in identifying where to focus onboarding efforts (e.g., geographies, provider profiles)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Evaluate new initiatives and clarify what is driving impact, and what is not, across any side of the marketplace&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Operating Cadence &amp;amp; Performance Management&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;[li_&amp;amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Build and maintain the operating cadence across Member Experience, Provider Growth &amp;amp; Operations, Clinical Operations, and Payer Operations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Own weekly metrics reviews, OKR tracking, and monthly reporting, including dashboards and performance analytics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Surface risks, identify gaps, and drive accountability across cross-functional initiatives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Cross-Functional Execution&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;[li_&amp;amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Partner with Product, Payer Operations, and other internal teams to operationalize new features and ensure real-world needs shape product decisions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Act as connective tissue across teams by surfacing insights, resolving misalignment, and helping navigate ambiguity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Special Projects &amp;amp; Zero-to-One Builds&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;[li_&amp;amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Own early-stage processes, programs, or capabilities without clear ownership, wherever they emerge across the marketplace&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Build, test, and scale new initiatives, then transition them to long-term owners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Support hiring and org-building as the team scales&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Take on ambiguous, high-priority problems with full ownership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Skills and Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;[li_&amp;amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;4+ years in business operations, strategy, chief of staff, or similar roles in high-growth startup, tech company, or consulting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Strong analytical skills with experience working directly with data, dashboards, and reporting (SQL preferred or willingness to learn)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Proven ability to own metrics and operating cadence in a fast-paced environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Strong prioritization and judgment in ambiguous, high-change environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Comfortable moving across functions and priorities — able to shift focus between payer, provider, and member workstreams as the business needs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Experience working across multiple functions and managing cross-functional execution without direct authority&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Excellent communication skills, including writing clear, structured memos and presentations for senior audiences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Background in healthcare, marketplace, or operations-heavy environments preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Highly organized, detail-oriented, and proactive in identifying problems before raised&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Motivated by outcomes over ownership and effective in collaborative environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;MBA a plus, but not required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;The best companies are made of the best people. We&#39;ve got ambitious goals with a long road ahead, and we move together. We work hard, stay energized, and make time to celebrate the wins along the way.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;See our careers page &lt;a class=&quot;underline underline underline-offset-2 decoration-1 decoration-current/40 hover:decoration-current focus:decoration-current&quot; href=&quot;https://polydactyl-astronaut-c79.notion.site/Careers-at-Fay-da5e9b1c8d2b42d8afe68065baa7a8b4&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt; to learn more about working on our team.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Compensation Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$120,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$185,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Fay is an equal opportunity employer. We celebrate diversity and are committed to creating an inclusive environment for all employees.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;notion-enable-hover&quot; data-token-index=&quot;0&quot;&gt;About Fay&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Fay, our mission is to make nutrition a foundational pillar of preventative care, improving outcomes, accessibility, and affordability at scale. We&#39;re building AI-powered infrastructure to transform preventative healthcare. Think that&#39;s bold? We&#39;re just getting started.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Today, Fay is a three-sided marketplace connecting providers, patients, and payers to revolutionize preventative care delivery. Our b2b2c business-in-a-box solution empowers dietitians to deliver high-quality, affordable nutrition care, helps patients take control of their health, and enables payers to build healthier member populations. Nutrition is our starting point, not the finish line. The platform we&#39;re building will expand into new areas of preventative health and wellness as we grow.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re proud to be one of the fastest-growing companies in healthtech, backed by category-defining investors like General Catalyst, Forerunner, 1984, and Goldman Sachs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ready to leverage AI-driven technology to transform preventative care and make a real-world impact on health? Let&#39;s talk.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About this Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role offers what many ambitious engineers are looking for:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🌟 Top-tier teammates&lt;/strong&gt;: We have an unusually talented and accomplished team of engineers who’ve held lead, staff, principal and director level roles in past jobs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🧑‍💻 A builder-centric culture&lt;/strong&gt;: We’re a fast-moving team with high standards, supported by thoughtful processes that keep things running smoothly without getting in the way.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;⚒️ Modern tools &amp;amp; best practices&lt;/strong&gt;: We use the best tool for the job at hand, and we’ve leaned into AI-driven development in all of the places it’s proven to be most effective.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🤝 A tight-knit, high-output team&lt;/strong&gt;: We’re a total of nine backend/full-stack engineers who collaborate closely, move quickly and have an unreasonable amount of fun together.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🤲 An ever-important mission&lt;/strong&gt;: We’re here to deliver high quality, convenient and affordable care to the hundreds of millions of Americans who need it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our software platform is well established and our user base is already quite large, but we’re still in the very early innings of building the world’s hub for healthy living. It will take more world-class engineers to bring our ambitious vision for Fay to life, and that’s why we’re hiring!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll be Doing:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Building features end-to-end&lt;/strong&gt;: All engineers lead projects and take ownership of their delivery and impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Contributing to the underlying platform&lt;/strong&gt;: We all pitch in to keep the platform stable and the developer experience smooth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Supporting engineering teammates&lt;/strong&gt;: We have lively engineering Slack channels and huddles where we run ideas by each other and problem-solve together.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Teaming up with product &amp;amp; design&lt;/strong&gt;: Every project is a team effort between engineering, product and design, and everyone involved pushes for the best outcome.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Maintaining a high standard&lt;/strong&gt;: We have a culture of doing things thoughtfully and doing them right, which comes with a commitment to uphold team best practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Making the product your baby&lt;/strong&gt;: We jump in to prototype our new feature ideas, remove developer pain points and fix nagging UI blemishes — all because we care about making things great!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Skills &amp;amp; Experience:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Backend or full-stack — the more of a generalist, the better&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;At least two years of professional experience and no experience cap — we’re hiring across all levels of seniority&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enough familiarity with Python and TypeScript+React to confidently make code contributions on day one&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear communication and an eagerness to collaborate effectively across engineering, product and design&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building user-facing products, with an eye for detail and a sense of what makes software feel intuitive and polished&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort working in fast-paced, dynamic startup environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong ownership mindset: you care about the outcome, not just your piece of the implementation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The best companies are made of the best people. There’s no shortage of work ahead, but we stay balanced and look forward to celebrating our wins as a team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;See our careers page &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.notion.so/Careers-at-Fay-da5e9b1c8d2b42d8afe68065baa7a8b4?pvs=21&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt; to learn more about working on our team.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Compensation Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$185,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$250,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Fay is an equal opportunity employer. We celebrate diversity and are committed to creating an inclusive environment for all employees.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
